ain scorch Moscow and  all the Dark One's with it  one problem nobody knows where it is  Artyom goes to the library a huge  archive full of librarians not the  bookish shashi kind but massive  intelligent music gorillas who love a  good stare down Artyom finally looks  enough of them in the eye to locate the  directions to d6  the last leg of this exhausting Odyssey  has our team extracting nuclear fuel  rods from a giant sagging flesh pile  called the biomass climbing to 540  tall Austin Kino broadcast tower and  being trapped in his own  subconsciousness by the dark ones  nobody said wiping out an entire species  was easy but Artyom persists and  successfully rains their nuclear fire on  the dark ones which is a pity because it  turns out they just wanted to be friends  a year later and word reaches Artyom of  a surviving Dark One can't think said  the key t manatee survival Miller  doesn't he tells our team to find and  kill the dark one with the help of  master sniper and his daughter Anna  Artyom finds the dark one but that's  just a kid they're both captured by the  Nazi Reich and separated but Artyom is  quickly rescued by Pavel more Azov a red  line grunts the pair form a close bond  until twist  Pavel reveals is actually a high-ranking  Red Line officer together with Red Line  general Corbett and treacherous Spartan  Ranger Lissitzky  he plans to take d6 by force tortured  and facing execution Artyom is saved by  a Leonid Musquin son of the red lines  leader he escapes and battles his way to  octobrush kya station where he discovers  a terrible secret the red line plans to  infect stations with a powerful strain  of the Ebola virus stolen from d6 and  then murdered the survivors until  they're the only remaining faction  Artyom reunites with and romances Ana  goes on a surreal Vision Quest with Khan  and resolves to protect the young Dark  One throughout this there are two major  revelations young Artyom is not only the  reason mutants got into the metro but  also the first person to meet a Dark One  one thrilling train rescue later and  Artyom and the dark one child are back  on the road to Polly's once there they  interrupt to peace settlements between  the major feuding factions to drop some  bombs truth not nuclear for once the red  lines leader is psychically coerced into  revealing their diabolical scheme and  all hell breaks loose  general Corbett smashes an armored train  straight into Artyom and the Rangers and  all hope appears to be lost  but then just as an injured our team is  about to self-destruct c6 a whole group  of Dark One's arrive in the nick of time  and wipe out the red line the young Dark  One and his fellow survivors bid our  team a fond farewell and promise to one  day return which brings us to the end of  our team story so far a story that will  continue  in Metro Exodus what we know is that  it's set to years after the events of  last lights and that Artyom and Anna are  now traveling cross-country along the  trans-siberian railway  why have they abandoned Metro what new  dangers will they face all will no doubt  be revealed when Metro Exodus launches  February 15 2019  [Music]

